### \`tls.d.bullet-chart\` — Bullet Chart

Per-KPI value bar with a target tick over shaded range bands, with labels and values. _(family: data; keywords: bullet, target, kpi, actual vs target, performance)_

**When:** Several KPIs each against its own target.
**Avoid:** Progress with no target (use tls.d.progress-bar).

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`items\` | yes | list of object (label, value, target, max) (1–5 items) | Each KPI: actual value, its target, optional scale maximum. |
| \`bands\` | no | enum: three \\\\| none | three = poor / ok / good shading. |
| \`format\` | no | enum: plain \\\\| compact \\\\| percent \\\\| currency |  |

\`\`\`json
{
  \\"id\\": \\"b_bullet\\",
  \\"type\\": \\"tls.d.bullet-chart\\",
  \\"props\\": {
    \\"items\\": [
      {
        \\"label\\": \\"Revenue\\",
        \\"value\\": 270,
        \\"target\\": 300,
        \\"max\\": 400
      },
      {
        \\"label\\": \\"Margin\\",
        \\"value\\": 22,
        \\"target\\": 20,
        \\"max\\": 30
      }
