### \`tls.d.gauge\` — Gauge

Half-circle dial: threshold bands, a needle or marker at the value, tick labels. _(family: data; keywords: gauge, dial, score, nps, threshold, health, risk)_

**When:** A score against thresholds (NPS, health, risk level).
**Avoid:** Plain completion with no thresholds (use tls.d.progress-ring).

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`value\` | yes | number |  |
| \`min\` | no | number | Scale start. Default 0. |
| \`max\` | no | number | Scale end. Default 100. |
| \`label\` | no | text (max 40 chars) | What is measured. |
| \`bands\` | no | list of object (to, tone) (0–5 items) | Ascending thresholds, each with a tone. |
| \`needle\` | no | enum: needle \\\\| marker |  |
| \`showTicks\` | no | boolean |  |
| \`format\` | no | enum: plain \\\\| compact \\\\| percent \\\\| currency |  |

\`\`\`json
{
  \\"id\\": \\"b_gauge\\",
  \\"type\\": \\"tls.d.gauge\\",
  \\"props\\": {
    \\"value\\": 42,
    \\"min\\": -100,
    \\"max\\": 100,
    \\"label\\": \\"NPS\\",
    \\"bands\\": [
      {
        \\"to\\": 0,
        \\"tone\\": \\"negative\\"
      },
      {
        \\"to\\": 50,
        \\"tone\\": \\"warning\\"
      },
      {
        \\"to\\": 100,
        \\"tone\\": \\"positive\\"
      }
    ]
  }
}
