### \`tls.d.line\` — Line Chart

Line chart with one line per series, labelled at the line ends. _(family: data; keywords: line, trend, time, series, chart, over time)_

**When:** Change over time, trends, comparing trajectories.
**Avoid:** Unordered categories (use tls.d.bar); only two time points (use tls.d.slope).

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`categories\` | yes | list of text (max 24 chars) (2–24 items) | Ordered x labels. |
| \`series\` | yes | list of object (name, values) (1–6 items) | One line each; null = gap. |
| \`curve\` | no | enum: linear \\\\| monotone |  |
| \`markers\` | no | enum: none \\\\| last \\\\| all |  |
| \`endLabels\` | no | boolean | Replaces the legend. |
| \`baseline\` | no | enum: auto \\\\| zero |  |
| \`gridlines\` | no | enum: major \\\\| none |  |
| \`format\` | no | enum: plain \\\\| compact \\\\| percent \\\\| currency |  |
| \`legend\` | no | enum: top \\\\| bottom \\\\| right \\\\| none |  |
| \`highlightIndex\` | no | number (min -1) | Series to emphasise; others dim. -1 = none. |

\`\`\`json
{
  \\"id\\": \\"b_line\\",
  \\"type\\": \\"tls.d.line\\",
  \\"props\\": {
    \\"categories\\": [
      \\"Q1\\",
      \\"Q2\\",
      \\"Q3\\",
      \\"Q4\\"
