### \`tls.d.pie\` — Pie Chart

Pie of up to six slices with outside, inside or legend labels and percentages. _(family: data; keywords: pie, share, proportion, whole, percent, chart)_

**When:** Share of a whole with up to 6 parts.
**Avoid:** Similar-sized shares (use tls.d.bar); a ring with a centre number (use tls.d.donut).

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`categories\` | yes | list of text (max 24 chars) (2–6 items) | One name per slice. |
| \`values\` | yes | list of number (2–6 items) | One non-negative number per category. |
| \`labels\` | no | enum: outside \\\\| inside \\\\| legend |  |
| \`showPercent\` | no | boolean |  |
| \`sort\` | no | enum: desc \\\\| none | desc = largest slice first. |
| \`highlightIndex\` | no | number (min -1) | Slice to emphasise; others dim. -1 = none. |
| \`startAngle\` | no | number | Degrees clockwise from 12 o'clock. |

\`\`\`json
{
  \\"id\\": \\"b_pie\\",
  \\"type\\": \\"tls.d.pie\\",
  \\"props\\": {
    \\"categories\\": [
      \\"Direct\\",
      \\"Partners\\",
      \\"Online\\"
    ],
    \\"values\\": [
      50,
      30,
      20
    ]
  }
}
\`\`\`

### \`tls.d.pricing\` — Pricing Plans

Side-by-side plan cards: name, price, features and a button, one plan featured. _(family: data; keywords: pricing, plans, tiers, packages, subscription, offer)_

**When:** Pricing tiers, packages, offer levels.
**Avoid:** Many features across plans (tls.d.compare-table).

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`plans\` | yes | list of object (name, price, period, description, features, cta, featured) (2–4 items) | Mark one plan featured. Keep feature lists to a similar length. |
| \`featuredStyle\` | no | enum: raised \\\\| outline \\\\| filled |  |
| \`checkIcon\` | no | icon |  |
| \`align\` | no | enum: top \\\\| stretch | stretch = equal height |
| \`showCta\` | no | boolean |  |
| \`showDescription\` | no | boolean |  |

\`\`\`json
{
  \\"id\\": \\"b_pricing\\",
  \\"type\\": \\"tls.d.pricing\\",
  \\"props\\": {
    \\"plans\\": [
      {
        \\"name\\": \\"Starter\\",
        \\"price\\": \\"Free\\",
        \\"features\\": [
          \\"1 project\\",
          \\"Community support\\"
        ],
        \\"cta\\": \\"Start\\"
      },
      {
        \\"name\\": \\"Team\\",
        \\"price\\": \\"$29\\",
        \\"period\\": \\"/ month\\",
        \\"description\\": \\"For teams\\",
        \\"features\\": [
          \\"Unlimited projects\\",
          \\"Priority support\\"
        ],
        \\"cta\\": \\"Try\\",
        \\"featured\\": true
      }
    ]
  }
}
\`\`\`

### \`tls.d.progress-bar\` — Progress Bars

Labelled bars filled to value / target, with percent or value text. _(family: data; keywords: progress, completion, target, goal, bar, percent)_

**When:** Completion of goals, budgets spent, survey agreement levels.
**Avoid:** Categories with no target (use tls.d.bar, horizontal); one big rate (use tls.d.progress-ring).

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`items\` | yes | list of object (label, value, max) (1–6 items) | Progress toward a target: value / max. Short labels. |
| \`showValue\` | no | enum: percent \\\\| value \\\\| none |  |
| \`thickness\` | no | enum: md \\\\| sm \\\\| lg |  |
| \`tone\` | no | enum: accent \\\\| status | status = red/amber/green by progress. |
| \`labelPos\` | no | enum: above \\\\| left | left saves height. |
| \`track\` | no | boolean |  |
| \`format\` | no | enum: plain \\\\| compact \\\\| percent \\\\| currency |  |

\`\`\`json
{
  \\"id\\": \\"b_progress\\",
  \\"type\\": \\"tls.d.progress-bar\\",
  \\"props\\": {
    \\"items\\": [
      {
        \\"label\\": \\"Hiring plan\\",
        \\"value\\": 72
      },
      {
        \\"label\\": \\"Budget\\",
        \\"value\\": 41,
        \\"max\\": 60
      }
    ],
    \\"tone\\": \\"status\\"
  }
}
\`\`\`

### \`tls.d.progress-ring\` — Progress Ring

Ring filled to value / max with the figure in the centre, plus label and caption. _(family: data; keywords: progress, ring, dial, percent, completion, score)_

**When:** One completion rate or score shown as a dial.
**Avoid:** Shares of several parts (use tls.d.donut); several bars (use tls.d.progress-bar).

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`value\` | yes | number | Ring fills to value / max. |
| \`max\` | no | number | Value that fills the ring. Default 100. |
| \`label\` | no | text (max 40 chars) | What it measures. |
| \`caption\` | no | text (max 80 chars) | One line of context. |
| \`thickness\` | no | enum: md \\\\| sm \\\\| lg |  |
| \`cap\` | no | enum: round \\\\| flat |  |
| \`tone\` | no | enum: accent \\\\| status | status = red/amber/green by progress. |
| \`format\` | no | enum: percent \\\\| plain \\\\| compact \\\\| currency | percent = share of max. |

\`\`\`json
{
  \\"id\\": \\"b_ring\\",
  \\"type\\": \\"tls.d.progress-ring\\",
  \\"props\\": {
    \\"value\\": 68,
    \\"label\\": \\"Course completion\\",
    \\"caption\\": \\"34 of 50 lessons\\",
    \\"tone\\": \\"status\\"
  }
}
\`\`\`

### \`tls.d.radar\` — Radar Chart

Spider chart: up to three shapes over three to eight axes, with grid rings and values. _(family: data; keywords: radar, spider, profile, skills, scores, criteria)_

**When:** Profiles on several criteria (skills, product scores).
**Avoid:** More than 3 series or 8 axes (use tls.d.compare-table); exact values (use tls.d.grouped-bar).

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`axes\` | yes | list of text (max 24 chars) (3–8 items) | Criteria around the dial, in order. |
| \`series\` | yes | list of object (name, values) (1–3 items) | One shape each; one value per axis. |
| \`max\` | no | number | Default: the largest value, rounded up. |
| \`fill\` | no | boolean |  |
| \`rings\` | no | number | Grid rings, 1-8. Default 4. |
| \`legend\` | no | enum: top \\\\| bottom \\\\| right \\\\| none |  |

\`\`\`json
{
  \\"id\\": \\"b_radar\\",
  \\"type\\": \\"tls.d.radar\\",
  \\"props\\": {
    \\"axes\\": [
      \\"Speed\\",
      \\"Cost\\",
      \\"Quality\\",
      \\"Support\\"
