### \`tls.d.waterfall\` — Waterfall Chart

Bridge chart: floating bars for changes, full bars for totals, optional connectors. _(family: data; keywords: waterfall, bridge, variance, walk, revenue, budget)_

**When:** Bridge from one figure to another (revenue bridge, budget variance).
**Avoid:** Independent values (use tls.d.bar).

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`steps\` | yes | list of object (label, value, kind) (3–12 items) | Start total, signed changes, end total. |
| \`connectors\` | no | boolean |  |
| \`colorBy\` | no | enum: sign \\\\| single | sign = positive / negative roles. |
| \`valueLabels\` | no | enum: end \\\\| none |  |
| \`gridlines\` | no | enum: major \\\\| none |  |
| \`format\` | no | enum: plain \\\\| compact \\\\| percent \\\\| currency |  |

