### \`tls.l.grid\` — Grid

Grid layout with configurable columns, rows, and gap. _(family: layout; keywords: grid, columns, rows, table)_

**When:** Use to arrange child blocks in a rows × columns grid.
**Avoid:** Do not use for a simple two-column layout (use tls.l.split) or for one line of items (use tls.l.row).

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`columns\` | no | number (min 1, max 12) | Number of grid columns. |
| \`rows\` | no | number (min 1, max 12) | Number of grid rows. |
| \`gap\` | no | enum: 3xs \\\\| 2xs \\\\| xs \\\\| sm \\\\| md \\\\| lg \\\\| xl \\\\| 2xl \\\\| 3xl \\\\| 4xl | Spacing between grid cells. |
| \`children\` | no | blocks (allow: layout, text, data, diagram, composite, media) | Child blocks arranged in grid cells (row-major order). |
| \`sizing\` | no | enum: equal \\\\| content | How to distribute space among cells: equal (same size) or content (sized to intrinsic). |

\`\`\`json
{
  \\"id\\": \\"b_grid\\",
  \\"type\\": \\"tls.l.grid\\",
  \\"props\\": {
    \\"columns\\": 2,
    \\"rows\\": 2,
    \\"gap\\": \\"md\\"
  },
  \\"children\\": []
}
\`\`\`

### \`tls.l.grid-guide\` — Grid Guide

Alignment grid guide with configurable divisions. Editor-only: invisible in exported output. _(family: layout; keywords: grid, guide, alignment, editor)_

**When:** Use in the editor to show alignment guides for precise positioning.
**Avoid:** Do not use to lay out content: it only draws guides in the editor (use tls.l.grid for real columns).

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`divisions\` | no | number (min 2, max 12) | Number of grid divisions on each axis. |

