### \`tls.m.avatar\` — Avatar

Portrait in a circle, rounded or square frame with name and role; initials when there is no photo. _(family: media; keywords: avatar, portrait, person, speaker, author, profile, headshot)_

**When:** Naming one speaker, author or contact person with a portrait.
**Avoid:** Several people (use tls.m.avatar-group); a full bio card (use tls.c.profile-card); a landscape photo (use tls.m.image).

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`image\` | no | image | Asset id or URL. Without one the avatar shows the name initials. |
| \`name\` | yes | text (max 40 chars) |  |
| \`role\` | no | text (max 50 chars) | Job title or relation, 1-6 words. |
| \`shape\` | no | enum: circle \\\\| rounded \\\\| square |  |
| \`size\` | no | enum: md \\\\| sm \\\\| lg \\\\| xl |  |
| \`layout\` | no | enum: stacked \\\\| inline | stacked = text under the portrait; inline = text beside it. |
| \`align\` | no | enum: center \\\\| start | Stacked layout only. |
| \`ring\` | no | boolean |  |
| \`showName\` | no | boolean |  |
| \`showRole\` | no | boolean |  |

\`\`\`json
{
  \\"id\\": \\"b_avatar\\",
  \\"type\\": \\"tls.m.avatar\\",
  \\"props\\": {
    \\"image\\": \\"asset-speaker\\",
    \\"name\\": \\"Dr. Tran Thi Lan\\",
    \\"role\\": \\"Head of Data Science\\",
    \\"size\\": \\"lg\\",
    \\"ring\\": true
  }
}
\`\`\`

### \`tls.m.avatar-group\` — Avatar Group

Overlapping row of small portraits (initials when no photo) with a +N overflow bubble. _(family: media; keywords: avatars, people, team, contributors, attendees, faces, stack)_

**When:** Who is involved at a glance: contributors, attendees, a project team.
**Avoid:** Names and roles matter (use tls.m.avatar one by one or a grid of tls.c.profile-card).

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`people\` | yes | list of object (image, name) (2–20 items) | 2-20 items {image?, name}. No image shows initials of the name. |
| \`max\` | no | number (min 1, max 12) | Avatars shown before the +N bubble (default 5). |
| \`size\` | no | enum: md \\\\| sm \\\\| lg |  |
| \`overlap\` | no | enum: md \\\\| none \\\\| lg |  |
| \`caption\` | no | text (max 60 chars) | e.g. \\"12 contributors\\". |

