### \`tls.m.decoration\` — Decoration

Decorative blob, arc, ring, dot grid, wave or corner in a theme colour; deterministic from a seed. _(family: media; keywords: decoration, blob, shape, wave, dots, ornament, background, accent)_

**When:** Visual interest on sparse slides: covers, dividers, quotes. Place it in its own region.
**Avoid:** Anything that carries meaning (use a real block, e.g. tls.t.statement); texture over dense text.

| Slot | Required | Type | Guidance |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`shape\` | no | enum: blob \\\\| arc \\\\| ring \\\\| dots \\\\| wave \\\\| corner | Rotation turns blob and arc freely; wave and corner snap to quarter turns; ring and dots ignore it. |
| \`tone\` | no | enum: accent \\\\| accent2 \\\\| alt \\\\| line |  |
| \`opacity\` | no | enum: soft \\\\| medium \\\\| strong | Ignored for tone alt, which is already quiet. |
| \`rotation\` | no | number (min 0, max 359) | Degrees. |
| \`seed\` | no | number (min 0, max 9999) | Same seed, same shape (blob, wave). |

\`\`\`json
{
  \\"id\\": \\"b_decoration\\",
  \\"type\\": \\"tls.m.decoration\\",
  \\"props\\": {
    \\"shape\\": \\"blob\\",
    \\"tone\\": \\"accent2\\",
    \\"opacity\\": \\"soft\\",
    \\"seed\\": 7
  }
}
\`\`\`

